00:07:00,000 --> 00:07:06,000
Stonehenge Apocalypse is a science fiction, action, tv
movie film directed by Paul Ziller.

2
00:14:00,000 --> 00:14:06,000
When a group of archaeologists dig up a human skeleton near Stonehenge, an
ancient piece of machinery hidden beneath the bedrock is discovered.

3
00:21:00,000 --> 00:21:06,000
Not knowing what it could be, the workers accidentally trigger the mechanism and
start a chain of events that may very well end the world as we know it

